165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As I sit down to share the highlights of this transformative year, my heart is filled with extreme gratitude and a sense of purpose. It is a privilege to present this annual report, encapsulating the collective efforts and impact we have achieved together through Joti foundation.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Joti Foundation was started in 2020 with a simple idea of giving back to society. As the journey unfolded we came across a lot of challenges, overcoming those challenges we have emerged as a responsible organization with a shared belief that every person regardless of their circumstances, deserves access to resources that can uplift and empower. The resilience of the communities we serve and the passion of our team inspire me daily. Together we are making strides towards a future where every individual has the opportunity to thrive.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This year we worked majorly in Punjab, touched upon the lives of many which you will see as you will turn the pages of this report. In the upcoming year, we look forward to expanding our reach, introducing innovative solutions and building upon the foundations we have laid.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Joti Foundation is more than an organization, it is a collective effort, a shared vision for a better world. As we embark on this journey, your continued support is invaluable.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
