/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Recognizing the urgency of the situation, we have undertaken a crucial intervention to address the water crisis in rural areas of the Malwa region. Through the installation of Water Purification Units \(WPUs\), we aim to provide immediate access to safe drinking water for the affected population. These WPUs utilize advanced purification technology to remove contaminants and ensure that the water meets quality standards for consumption.)
/E (Recognizing the urgency of the situation, we have undertaken a crucial intervention to address the water crisis in rural areas of the Malwa region. Through the installation of Water Purification Units \(WPUs\), we aim to provide immediate access to safe drinking water for the affected population. These WPUs utilize advanced purification technology to remove contaminants and ensure that the water meets quality standards for consumption.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Since the inception of our intervention, Joti Foundation has made significant strides in providing access to safe drinking water in the Malwa region. To date, we have successfully installed six water purification units in districts of Sri Muktsar Sahib and Fazilka. These units serve as lifelines for the community, providing safe drinking water to approximately 30,000 people daily. )
/E (Since the inception of our intervention, Joti Foundation has made significant strides in providing access to safe drinking water in the Malwa region. To date, we have successfully installed six water purification units in districts of Sri Muktsar Sahib and Fazilka. These units serve as lifelines for the community, providing safe drinking water to approximately 30,000 people daily. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
