/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The initiative is to conduct mega screenings for approximately 29,00000 government school children across Punjab. Through these screenings, the we aimed to identify students with vision impairments and provide them with free-of-cost spectacles, thereby enabling them to access the education they deserve without hindrance.)
/E (The initiative is to conduct mega screenings for approximately 29,00000 government school children across Punjab. Through these screenings, the we aimed to identify students with vision impairments and provide them with free-of-cost spectacles, thereby enabling them to access the education they deserve without hindrance.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The implementation of the 'Clearer Vision for Brighter Future' initiative involved meticulous planning and coordination at every stage. Joti Foundation collaborated with government authorities, educational institutions, and healthcare professionals to ensure the seamless execution of the program. Camps were set up in each school of the districts, reaching even the most remote areas to ensure that no child was left behind. )
/E (The implementation of the 'Clearer Vision for Brighter Future' initiative involved meticulous planning and coordination at every stage. Joti Foundation collaborated with government authorities, educational institutions, and healthcare professionals to ensure the seamless execution of the program. Camps were set up in each school of the districts, reaching even the most remote areas to ensure that no child was left behind. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
