<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The impact of the initiative was profound and far-reaching. By conducting mega screenings and providing free spectacles, Joti Foundation significantly improved the visual health of thousands of government school children. )
/E (The impact of the initiative was profound and far-reaching. By conducting mega screenings and providing free spectacles, Joti Foundation significantly improved the visual health of thousands of government school children. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (One such poignant story is that of Sukhchain, a bright young boy whose potential was hindered by untreated vision problems. During our screening process, Sukhchain was found to have a severe vision impairment, with a prescription of 6 diopters, yet he was not wearing spectacles due to his family's financial constraints.)
/E (One such poignant story is that of Sukhchain, a bright young boy whose potential was hindered by untreated vision problems. During our screening process, Sukhchain was found to have a severe vision impairment, with a prescription of 6 diopters, yet he was not wearing spectacles due to his family's financial constraints.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In this journey we came across hundreds of children like Sukhchain and transformed their lives through this initiative. In the FY 2023-2024 we covered various districts such as Sri Mukstar Sahib, Bathinda, Fazilka and Sangrur and screened more than 250000 children. Amongst these we identified and provided spectacles to over 10,000 children.)
/E (In this journey we came across hundreds of children like Sukhchain and transformed their lives through this initiative. In the FY 2023-2024 we covered various districts such as Sri Mukstar Sahib, Bathinda, Fazilka and Sangrur and screened more than 250000 children. Amongst these we identified and provided spectacles to over 10,000 children.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The provision of corrective eyewear not only enhanced their ability to see clearly but also contributed to their overall well-being and academic performance. Moreover, by addressing vision impairments at an early stage, the initiative helped prevent long-term complications and potential dropout rates due to undiagnosed visual problems.)
/E (The provision of corrective eyewear not only enhanced their ability to see clearly but also contributed to their overall well-being and academic performance. Moreover, by addressing vision impairments at an early stage, the initiative helped prevent long-term complications and potential dropout rates due to undiagnosed visual problems.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Beyond providing direct services, we also prioritized community engagement and awareness-building efforts. In this initiative we gave a very significant role to the teachers of the districts. Through proper workshops and training we educated teachers how to do initial screenings with the help of Snellen chart. This made teachers a very important part of the entire project and worked towards sensitizing them about this cause.)
/E (Beyond providing direct services, we also prioritized community engagement and awareness-building efforts. In this initiative we gave a very significant role to the teachers of the districts. Through proper workshops and training we educated teachers how to do initial screenings with the help of Snellen chart. This made teachers a very important part of the entire project and worked towards sensitizing them about this cause.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
