227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In August, Punjab was faced with one of the most devastating floods in recent memory, leaving a trail of destruction in its wake and impacting the lives of countless individuals and families. As floodwaters inundated vast swathes of land, leaving countless families displaced and livelihoods destroyed, we mobilized our expert teams to provide immediate assistance. Recognizing the urgency of the situation, our teams sprang into action, deploying motor rafts to facilitate evacuations and deliver crucial medical aid to those stranded in the floodwaters.)
/E (In August, Punjab was faced with one of the most devastating floods in recent memory, leaving a trail of destruction in its wake and impacting the lives of countless individuals and families. As floodwaters inundated vast swathes of land, leaving countless families displaced and livelihoods destroyed, we mobilized our expert teams to provide immediate assistance. Recognizing the urgency of the situation, our teams sprang into action, deploying motor rafts to facilitate evacuations and deliver crucial medical aid to those stranded in the floodwaters.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In the days that followed, as access to remote villages became increasingly challenging due to flooded roads and infrastructure damage, we adapted our approach, utilizing waterways to reach isolated communities. Despite the logistical hurdles, our teams navigated treacherous waters to deliver essential supplies, including ration packs and other vital items, to those in need.)
/E (In the days that followed, as access to remote villages became increasingly challenging due to flooded roads and infrastructure damage, we adapted our approach, utilizing waterways to reach isolated communities. Despite the logistical hurdles, our teams navigated treacherous waters to deliver essential supplies, including ration packs and other vital items, to those in need.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Through our concerted efforts, we were able to make a tangible difference in the lives of thousands of flood-affected individuals and families. By providing evacuation facilities, medical aid, and essential supplies to 3000 households across five villages, we alleviated immediate suffering and offered a glimmer of hope amidst the devastation.)
/E (Through our concerted efforts, we were able to make a tangible difference in the lives of thousands of flood-affected individuals and families. By providing evacuation facilities, medical aid, and essential supplies to 3000 households across five villages, we alleviated immediate suffering and offered a glimmer of hope amidst the devastation.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Moreover, our response efforts extended beyond mere relief provision, as we remained committed to supporting communities in their long-term recovery and rebuilding efforts. By prioritizing the most vulnerable populations and ensuring equitable distribution of resources, we sought to foster resilience and empower communities to chart a path towards recovery and renewal.)
/E (Moreover, our response efforts extended beyond mere relief provision, as we remained committed to supporting communities in their long-term recovery and rebuilding efforts. By prioritizing the most vulnerable populations and ensuring equitable distribution of resources, we sought to foster resilience and empower communities to chart a path towards recovery and renewal.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
