/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (We recognize the profound impact that disability can have on the lives of individuals. In response to this, we launched project 'SAMARTH,' which translates to 'capable,' with the aim of empowering differently abled sportsmen and fostering their talents. Through this initiative, we seek to create a supportive and inclusive environment where these athletes can reach their full potential, inspiring countless individuals in the process. )
/E (We recognize the profound impact that disability can have on the lives of individuals. In response to this, we launched project 'SAMARTH,' which translates to 'capable,' with the aim of empowering differently abled sportsmen and fostering their talents. Through this initiative, we seek to create a supportive and inclusive environment where these athletes can reach their full potential, inspiring countless individuals in the process. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The primary objective of project SAMARTH is to empower differently abled athletes by providing them with the necessary support and resources to excel in sports. We aim to foster a sense of belonging and inclusion, enabling these athletes to showcase their abilities on various platforms. By nurturing their talents and providing opportunities for growth, we aspire to break down societal barriers and challenge stereotypes surrounding disability in sports.)
/E (The primary objective of project SAMARTH is to empower differently abled athletes by providing them with the necessary support and resources to excel in sports. We aim to foster a sense of belonging and inclusion, enabling these athletes to showcase their abilities on various platforms. By nurturing their talents and providing opportunities for growth, we aspire to break down societal barriers and challenge stereotypes surrounding disability in sports.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Project SAMARTH is implemented through a multifaceted approach that encompasses various elements, including training, mentorship, and access to competitive opportunities. We work closely with differently abled athletes to identify their strengths and interests, tailoring our support to meet their individual needs.Our foundation provides training facilities, coaching support, and access to specialized equipment to help athletes hone their skills and compete at the highest levels. Additionally, we foster a supportive community where athletes can connect with peers, share experiences, and inspire one another to achieve greatness.)
/E (Project SAMARTH is implemented through a multifaceted approach that encompasses various elements, including training, mentorship, and access to competitive opportunities. We work closely with differently abled athletes to identify their strengths and interests, tailoring our support to meet their individual needs.Our foundation provides training facilities, coaching support, and access to specialized equipment to help athletes hone their skills and compete at the highest levels. Additionally, we foster a supportive community where athletes can connect with peers, share experiences, and inspire one another to achieve greatness.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The impact of SAMARTH extends far beyond the realm of sports, touching the lives of differently abled athletes and their communities. Through our efforts, these athletes have had the opportunity to represent India on state, national, and international levels, showcasing their talent and determination on a global stage. Moreover, this project serves as a powerful symbol of inclusion and empowerment, challenging perceptions of disability and celebrating the abilities of all individuals. By providing a platform for differently abled athletes to thrive, we inspire countless others to pursue their passions and overcome barriers in their own lives.)
/E (The impact of SAMARTH extends far beyond the realm of sports, touching the lives of differently abled athletes and their communities. Through our efforts, these athletes have had the opportunity to represent India on state, national, and international levels, showcasing their talent and determination on a global stage. Moreover, this project serves as a powerful symbol of inclusion and empowerment, challenging perceptions of disability and celebrating the abilities of all individuals. By providing a platform for differently abled athletes to thrive, we inspire countless others to pursue their passions and overcome barriers in their own lives.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
